  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "70d37607-01cd-4e37-98a6-f1b01fd3414c",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "064bd98f-7234-4cb0-9fd8-a7fab9341a46",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe o início do expediente.</p><p><strong>Hoy empiezo con el correo.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Hoje eu começo pelo e-mail.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bba688eef5d14f5e9063462b538bb43b_c01-inicio-del-dia-realista.png?Expires=1794099559&Signature=csnvKCMZFAjg00MylszN6hCuz0eBQdWzd7vaKLavMmcR28HCHU9YnIEhJG2Xi~poVpx-ErzV4iExliur7m3wAcsjUreWXdV~HLugai3DFR3i-f6SwNspQOB8KzuFmK8HoFxHpmM1LpeAOVlCHPNdTzuBO5UyyjtjG7t2ifqB4i6bgVRIS5fRord0pnPz-N4iGH15UUD3a-~xbEVVvfrd~3OH0i7NyrfWH7jgbLDl6tiRu~64uRiod15pbPNb-vhnkVJvopNCKe-iLTY3QMpQVg5olxtr7B~4q2KGrqPs9tSCHUQPIegVD85dZJ-kEDMHh1e3gQdKghT2aWMLgFf2pA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ed15cfb6ed264b7c8431fd41823f9ca9_c01-hoy-empiezo-con-el-correo.mp3?Expires=1794099559&Signature=yUXdHw5U3ySvTum1t6UlEPWmIm8iMDs17juIW2sEJmaZ6d~MWuXNiDvTnMkzfb-abN9DPHLnLGocT3vQYTg6LSgcv5kC~IST3fhHrUSjDJmFXBH2Bbc349JgoESYxlN7owkEUwFvkC7EABSuMEVuAR6ylysmVxSP8iGgsXkpmfLCxY0ZTgnAgRGmHroPL7rW0Ya6jWweIgyjHmE5zcrzqwptdZUab1dmIlyi9VghUUs3SbN3SYAbP69mo9QZdFvv31a~sGXqHvDi39kkPrt9vCPiFBO5NQW7dv9SnLFW50DBXggUc6zKsOyxyIbH-quKwmcsbpvktgXuomrqDEoj-A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
